# Phase 4B-1R.7: API bearer tokens. The server fails closed (HTTP 503 on every
# /api/* route) unless BOTH are set, differ, and are >= 43 base64url characters.
# Generate each with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'))"
# Put real values only in .env.local (gitignored) or the launcher's environment.
# Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_. Rotation requires restarting the server.
DASK_API_TASK_TOKEN=
DASK_API_APPROVE_TOKEN=
